---

# Cards

Cards should use

- white background
- subtle border
- rounded corners
- minimal shadow

Avoid large shadows.

Avoid glassmorphism.

Avoid neumorphism.

---

# Statistics Cards

Dashboard statistics should use simple cards.

Example

Patients Today

124

+8%

Instead of decorative illustrations.

Cards should prioritize information density.

---

# Tables

Use modern data tables.

Features

- Search
- Filters
- Pagination
- Column sorting
- Bulk actions
- Row actions

Avoid overly colorful table headers.

